I tested EA 26.04  image on CorticalLabs board, The image seems to boot fine on that board.
It is able to enumerate major periphs like eMMC, ethernet, NVME over PCIe, USB(USB-A, USB-C).
Couple of critical points

Image as produced by PE team's script do not boot as it follows bootefi flow which is not supported in Cortical Labs bootloader
There are few changes that need to be done in image format to make it successfully boot with current boot firmware that board has.
I think this should be  good enough to propose 0T to the customer

unnecessry services like fancontrol.service,fwupd.service, very noisy apparmor
is lima going to be default driver for MALI 400 MP2 GPU in Kria SOC

